{"content":"{\n  \"chapter_contract_id\": \"contract:v2-n-9-1:v2\",\n  \"node_id\": \"v2_n_9_1\",\n  \"schema_version\": \"ordered_chapter_draft_candidate.v1\",\n  \"known_evidence_ids\": [],\n  \"blocks\": [\n    {\n      \"block_id\": \"p-9-1-001\",\n      \"kind\": \"paragraph\",\n      \"text\": \"9.1 疗效评估\",\n      \"evidence_refs\": [],\n      \"source_locator\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"block_id\": \"p-9-1-002\",\n      \"kind\": \"paragraph\",\n      \"text\": \"本章承接疗效评估章节的章首评估框架义务，用于说明主要和次要疗效终点的定义、测量口径、评估者角色及其与已确认研究目的和估计目标的追溯关系；本章疗效评估安排应服从试验参与者安全与数据完整性的总体要求。本章疗效评估框架范围：【待补充：本章疗效评估的总体框架与范围：该项待研究团队确认后补充】。\",\n      \"evidence_refs\": [],\n      \"source_locator\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"block_id\": \"p-9-1-003\",\n      \"kind\": \"paragraph\",\n      \"text\": \"主要目的为：在CLDN18.2阳性（肿瘤细胞≥40%且染色强度≥2+）的不可切除或转移性晚期胃癌试验参与者中，评估合成药G 2.2 mg/kg Q3W（每3周）静脉输注联合背景RAS抑制剂相较于匹配安慰剂联合背景RAS抑制剂，由独立影像学评估委员会（IRC）评估的客观缓解率（ORR）差异。主要终点为由IRC评估的ORR。主要终点应直接回链上述已确认主要目的，并应与主要估计目标保持一致；主要终点对应的估计目标：【待补充：主要终点对应的目标人群、变量、伴发事件处理策略及群体汇总方式：该项待研究团队确认后补充】。\",\n      \"evidence_refs\": [],\n      \"source_locator\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"block_id\": \"p-9-1-004\",\n      \"kind\": \"paragraph\",\n      \"text\": \"主要终点、目的与估计目标的映射见表9.1-1。\",\n      \"evidence_refs\": [],\n      \"source_locator\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"block_id\": \"t-9-1-001\",\n      \"kind\": \"table\",\n      \"evidence_refs\": [],\n      \"table\": {\n        \"table_id\": \"efficacy:table:endpoint_mapping\",\n        \"block_id\": \"t-9-1-001\",\n        \"title\": \"表 9.1-1 主要疗效终点与目的、估计目标映射\",\n        \"domain\": \"objectives_endpoints\",\n        \"role\": \"body_content\",\n        \"review_state\": \"ai_draft\",\n        \"header_row_count\": 1,\n        \"columns\": [\n          {\n            \"column_id\": \"col_objective\",\n            \"label\": \"目的\",\n            \"order\": 0,\n            \"semantic_role\": \"objective\",\n            \"style_role\": \"header\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"column_id\": \"col_endpoint\",\n            \"label\": \"终点\",\n            \"order\": 1,\n            \"semantic_role\": \"endpoint\",\n            \"style_role\": \"header\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"column_id\": \"col_estimand\",\n            \"label\": \"估计目标\",\n            \"order\": 2,\n            \"semantic_role\": \"estimand\",\n            \"style_role\": \"header\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          {\n            \"row_id\": \"row_header\",\n            \"order\": 0,\n            \"style_role\": \"header\",\n            \"cells\": [\n              {\n                \"cell_id\": \"efficacy:cell:objective.header\",\n                \"row_id\": \"row_header\",\n                \"column_id\": \"col_objective\",\n                \"text\": \"目的\",\n                \"style_role\": \"header\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"cell_id\": \"efficacy:cell:endpoint.header\",\n                \"row_id\": \"row_header\",\n                \"column_id\": \"col_endpoint\",\n                \"text\": \"终点\",\n                \"style_role\": \"header\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"cell_id\": \"efficacy:cell:estimand.header\",\n                \"row_id\": \"row_header\",\n                \"column_id\": \"col_estimand\",\n                \"text\": \"估计目标\",\n                \"style_role\": \"header\"\n              }\n            ]\n          },\n          {\n            \"row_id\": \"row_primary\",\n            \"order\": 1,\n            \"cells\": [\n              {\n                \"cell_id\": \"efficacy:cell:objective\",\n                \"row_id\": \"row_primary\",\n                \"column_id\": \"col_objective\",\n                \"text\": \"在CLDN18.2阳性（肿瘤细胞≥40%且染色强度≥2+）的不可切除或转移性晚期胃癌试验参与者中，评估合成药G 2.2 mg/kg Q3W静脉输注联合背景RAS抑制剂相较于匹配安慰剂联合背景RAS抑制剂，由IRC评估的ORR差异。\",\n                \"provenance_lineage\": [],\n                \"source_locator\": \"\",\n                \"style_role\": \"body\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"cell_id\": \"efficacy:cell:endpoint\",\n                \"row_id\": \"row_primary\",\n                \"column_id\": \"col_endpoint\",\n                \"text\": \"由IRC评估的ORR。\",\n                \"provenance_lineage\": [],\n                \"source_locator\": \"\",\n                \"style_role\": \"body\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"cell_id\": \"efficacy:cell:estimand\",\n                \"row_id\": \"row_primary\",\n                \"column_id\": \"col_estimand\",\n                \"text\": \"【待补充：主要终点对应的目标人群、变量、伴发事件处理策略及群体汇总方式：该项待研究团队确认后补充】\",\n                \"provenance_lineage\": [],\n                \"source_locator\": \"\",\n                \"style_role\": \"body\"\n              }\n            ]\n          }\n        ],\n        \"notes\": [],\n        \"source_locator\": \"\",\n        \"version\": 0\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"block_id\": \"p-9-1-005\",\n      \"kind\": \"paragraph\",\n      \"text\": \"主要终点的测量方法、派生规则与评估工具：【待补充：由IRC评估ORR的测量方法、应答确认规则、派生规则与评估工具：该项待研究团队确认后补充】。主要终点及未特别说明的IRC评估终点所依据的命名量表/影像评估标准及版本：【待补充：用于主要终点评估的命名量表或影像评估标准及其版本：该项待研究团队确认后补充】。评估者角色、资质与培训要求：【待补充：IRC及其他评估者的角色、资质与培训要求：该项待研究团队确认后补充】。评估时点与窗口应与已确认研究流程表（SoA）一致，不得新建冲突时间表；具体评估时点和允许窗口：【待补充：主要和次要终点评估在已确认研究流程表中的具体时点与允许窗口：该项待研究团队确认后补充】。\",\n      \"evidence_refs\": [],\n      \"source_locator\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"block_id\": \"p-9-1-006\",\n      \"kind\": \"paragraph\",\n      \"text\": \"次要终点中，缓解持续时间（DoR）定义为IRC评估下自首次记录确认完全缓解（CR）或部分缓解（PR）至首次记录疾病进展或任何原因死亡的时间；无事件者在最后可评估肿瘤评估日删失，删失规则应在统计分析计划（SAP）中预先固定。疾病控制率（DCR）定义为IRC评估下确认CR、PR或疾病稳定（SD）且SD持续时间至少6周的试验参与者比例；最终阈值需在SAP中确认。无进展生存期（PFS）定义为IRC评估下自随机化日至首次记录疾病进展或任何原因死亡的时间，进展判定和删失规则应预先定义。总生存期（OS）定义为自随机化日至任何原因死亡的时间。安全性和耐受性包括治疗中出现的不良事件（AE）、严重不良事件（SAE）、特别关注不良事件（AESI）、输液反应、剂量暂停/下调、因毒性终止治疗及死亡；具体AE编码、分级和AESI定义需在SAP中预先规定。研究者按实体瘤疗效评价标准（RECIST）v1.1评估的ORR应作为IRC主要评估的敏感性和一致性分析。合成药G的药代动力学（PK）参数和抗药抗体（ADA）/中和抗体发生率（如采样可行）也属于次要终点测量口径；具体采样时点和检测方法需另行定义。上述次要终点对应的次要目的及估计目标：【待补充：上述次要终点对应的次要目的及估计目标（目标人群、变量、伴发事件处理策略及群体汇总方式）：该项待研究团队确认后补充】。\",\n      \"evidence_refs\": [],\n      \"source_locator\": \"\"\n    }\n  ]\n}","receipt":{"idempotency_key":"chapter-draft.generate.v1","input_artifacts":[{"ref":"chapter-intake","sha256":"ba4e95fb095a28eabecc00ca1d8f5b50b3ff376a0db04ba77b5e30670577b438"}],"logical_call_id":"call:chapter-draft:51299c0eb3fd1dfad11e26007b4d923456d3a2f40e3681a231941f1f39e5ef2a:chapter-generate","node_execution_contract_id":"nec:chapter-draft:51299c0eb3fd1dfad11e26007b4d923456d3a2f40e3681a231941f1f39e5ef2a:chapter-generate","observed_model":"deepseek-flash","observed_provider":"deepseek","output_schema_ref":"https://protocol-v3.local/schemas/ordered-chapter-draft-candidate.v1.json","output_sha256":"62fbcdc39d67111edd6d144ac5e7e633d2796972c56a3f29a8225a04880141b2","prompt_sha256":"5322c0235bbedc2213b004747cbd757992154e907fd360b9bf7be0e09db8863e","provider_session_id":"f7fc84a2-2cf7-49a7-9b76-18c7d8af44d0","requested_reasoning_effort":"max"},"schema":"model_response.v1"}